  "description": {
   "en": "\"I just don’t get people who cheat.\"\nCram school instructor Mishio Ryousuke truly believes that. One night, he helps a woman quietly crying alone in a bar. But when they meet again later at the cram school, he realizes—she's one of his student's parents.\n\n(Source: Our Feel, translated)",
   "ja": "本気でそう思っている塾講師の三塩遼介。ある夜、遼介は消え入りそうに一人泣いていた女性を居酒屋で助けた。後日、塾で再会した彼女は、生徒の保護者だった――。"
  },
